sequenceDiagram
  participant Drv as molt driver
  participant Dut as odc-device-*
  participant Mod as QMI modem
  participant Gr as graph CLI

  Drv->>Dut: apply cellular-only fixture
  Drv->>Dut: systemctl restart odc-onboard-v2
  Dut->>Mod: qmi connect
  Mod-->>Dut: wwan0 up + IP
  Drv->>Gr: graph.status cellular0
  Gr-->>Drv: wan_ready / connected
  Drv->>Dut: disconnect / reconnect cases
  Dut->>Mod: session teardown + reattach
  Drv->>Drv: archive ip + journal evidence
